  (text "FIELD DOMAIN"
    (at 243.84 149.86 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.524 1.524))
      (justify left top))
    (uuid "6bac0371-2894-5330-a1e1-cbbc01e5ae5f"))
  (text "J22: pivot servo communications\n1 = Common (-BATT)\n5 = D1 (+); 9 = D0 (-)\nShell = Chassis; no power output"
    (at 327.66 119.38 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27))
      (justify left top))
    (uuid "5061b0b1-3379-5578-a0dc-ba6196554c06"))
  (text "JP160 + JP161: closed = 560R bias pair enabled.\nOpen BOTH if another node provides bus bias.\nJP162: closed = 120R termination enabled.\nUse termination only at the two cable ends."
    (at 228.6 108.0 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27))
      (justify left top))
    (uuid "c80b11cb-a6d7-5f41-81fb-372e7bc58f90"))
  (text "USART2 / AF7: PD5 TX, PD6 RX, PD4 active-high hardware DE.\nDE low: listen, driver off. DE high: transmit, receiver disabled.\n10k pull-down keeps the driver off during reset; TX/RX idle high.\nSet baud, parity, address and turnaround timing to the servo manual."
    (at 20.32 205.74 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27))
      (justify left top))
    (uuid "070b1c74-5a1d-54df-a10f-01f095ff2f97"))
  (text "U160 A = D1 (+), U160 B = D0 (-); vendor A/B names differ.\nTwisted D1/D0 pair plus Common; bond shield to chassis.\nDE9 assignment follows Modbus Serial Line V1.02, section 3.5.1.\nServo model and cable pinout remain to be confirmed."
    (at 228.6 205.74 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27))
      (justify left top))
    (uuid "ae76a6ee-093b-5dfc-8a1c-c3d74140eb4f"))
  (text "Logic: existing +3V3_STM32 / GND_STM32. Bus: existing +5V_FIELD / -BATT.\nNo new converter. Bus shares the battery field return; isolation protects STM32 logic.\nPlace each 100n at its VCC pin; keep copper clear of the isolation barrier.\nU160 includes bus ESD protection; cable EMC and rail loading still need bench checks."
    (at 20.32 236.22 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27))
      (justify left top))
    (uuid "7b1b031d-6e28-530c-809d-3b652e01b99a"))
  (text "Hardware provision: half-duplex RS-485, up to 500 kbit/s.\nFirmware Modbus client and drive register map are separate work.\nJP160/161/162 are copper-bridged solder links, closed by default."
    (at 228.6 236.22 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27))
      (justify left top))
    (uuid "ea042acb-26c2-5576-b602-580efece2389"))
